## catjs-irt Changelog

### v0.2.0

* NEW: ship pre-built browser bundles in `dist/` (`catjs-irt.js`, `catjs-irt.min.js`, global `catjsIrt`) for `<script>`/CDN usage without a bundler
* NEW: build browser bundles with esbuild via `npm run build` (runs automatically through the `prepack` hook on `npm publish`)
* ENH: `exports` map now includes a `default` condition, so CJS/`require()` consumers can load the package
* ENH: require Node.js >= 20 (`engines`)

### v0.1.0 -- Initial Release
